after reload lines: ["n_bram: Saved the world twice and still answers the door. Good lad.","n_nell: Arthur came by. He wanted to know if a paddle boat could use a coupler. I said no. He said \"yet\".","n_odile: Category: machinery. Sub-category: humming."]
